<title>JAPAN: Nikko Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nikko Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.41		vs	    5.52</p>
<p> Operating    prft 48 million	 vs    loss 86 million</p>
<p> Current	 loss 2 million	 vs    loss 35 million</p>
<p> Net	     loss 3 million	 vs    loss 42 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 0.38 yen	  vs     loss 4.23 yen</p>
<p> Shares		10 million	 vs	   10 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Nikko Electric Industry Co Ltd is a major automotive electrical equipment maker.</p>
